  "notes": [
    "D0 and D1 are serial: never use them.",
    "PWM (~) pins: 2 to 13 and 44 to 46 (timers 0 to 5).",
    "The Servo library uses Timer5 first, so analogWrite does not work on pins 44, 45 and 46 while a servo is used.",
    "tone() uses Timer2 and breaks PWM on pins 9 and 10.",
    "A0 to A15 are analog inputs (they also work as digital pins).",
    "Buttons are wired pin-to-GND and read with INPUT_PULLUP: pressed is LOW."
  ],
